      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'you have 1000 health, so shouldn''t need to worry about dying, but if
    you do you will need to restart the game.

    Walls can be broken down with
    specific weapon types.

    Blue melts with fire

    pink breaks with green
    chomper

    orange breaks with water and icing (white)

    Icing slows yourself
    and bad guys

    pink makes you stuck

    fire burns every 1 second

    you
    can cancel out effect cubes with other opposite attacks'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
